{"title": "Shunt Through Space", "pageid": 32754, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shunt_Through_Space", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp, /w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Shunt Through Space</b> is a passive feature unique to <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a> that lets him teleport after being damaged.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Using a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> after being damaged, Ptaris teleports as far as he can from the attacker. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042437\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 477/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1960/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1178/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 121/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 737011/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.167      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.167      1 -total\n 29.24%    7.652      1 Template:R\n 15.73%    4.117      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.40%    4.031      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 14.82%    3.879      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.62%    3.825      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.56%    1.977      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  6.94%    1.817      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  5.48%    1.435      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32754-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715042437 and revision id 255133. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}